<title>UK: Austria trade bids for free mkt barley at EU tende.</title>
<headline>Austria trade bids for free mkt barley at EU tende.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian traders have submitted bids for 1,000 tonnes of free market barley at Thursday's EU grains tender, member state officials said.</p>
<p>The bids are for a refund of 30.95 ECUs per tonne, the officials said.</p>
<p>There were no bids for other free market grains, they said.</p>
<p>The EU cereals management committee will adjudicate tender bids at its meeting on Thursday afternoon.</p>
<p>--Christopher Lyddon, London newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
